<title>FINLAND: Finnish May jobless rate rises to 16.7 pct -SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish May jobless rate rises to 16.7 pct -SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish unemployment rate rose to 16.7 percent in May from 16.6 percent in April, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>			 May 1997    April 1997	May 1996</p>
<p> Unemployed	   438,000	 424,000	 435,000</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)  16.7	    16.6	    17.0</p>
<p>The figures are not seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>Finland's labour ministry, calculating on a different basis, earlier said the May unemployment rate fell to 15.5 percent from 16.1 percent in April. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
